&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Reference&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fractalforums.com/3d-fractal-generation/true-3d-mandlebrot-type-fractal/&quot;&gt;http://www.fractalforums.com/3d-fractal-generation/true-3d-mandlebrot-type-fractal/&lt;br&gt;
